{
  "id": "u13-l05",
  "unit": "u13-requests",
  "title": "Hello, who's speaking?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**Phone talk.** Calls start with **হ্যালো** (or সালাম). Say who you are with **বলছি** 'I am speaking': **আমি রাফি বলছি** 'This is Rafi'. To ask who's calling: **কে বলছেন?** (polite, -ছেন).\n\nThe other person often says **জি, বলেন** 'Yes, go ahead'.\n\n**শুনতে পাচ্ছি** = 'I can hear' (literally 'I am getting to hear'): **আমার কথা শুনতে পাচ্ছেন?** 'Can you hear me?', **শুনতে পাচ্ছি না** 'I can't hear'.\n\nTo end a call, Bangladeshis say **আচ্ছা, এখন রাখি**: **রাখা** 'put down', so 'OK, I'll hang up now'. **পরে ফোন করব** 'I'll call later'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "hyalo",
      "bn": "হ্যালো",
      "tr": "hyalo",
      "en": "hello (on the phone)",
      "notes": "Answers and starts phone calls. Face to face, people greet with সালাম or নমস্কার."
    },
    {
      "id": "bolchhen",
      "bn": "বলছেন",
      "tr": "bolchhen",
      "en": "you are speaking (polite)",
      "notes": "Present continuous of বলা. কে বলছেন? 'Who's speaking?'"
    },
    {
      "id": "bolchhi",
      "bn": "বলছি",
      "tr": "bolchhi",
      "en": "I am speaking",
      "notes": "On the phone: আমি রাফি বলছি 'This is Rafi (speaking)'."
    },
    {
      "id": "nombor",
      "bn": "নম্বর",
      "tr": "nombor",
      "en": "number",
      "notes": "ফোন নম্বর 'phone number'. Also spelled নাম্বার."
    },
    {
      "id": "pachchhi",
      "bn": "পাচ্ছি",
      "tr": "pachchhi",
      "en": "I am getting",
      "notes": "Present continuous of পাওয়া 'get'. শুনতে পাচ্ছি 'I can hear'."
    },
    {
      "id": "pachchhen",
